          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            For a narrow double-hung window at least 22 inches wide, the Midea U-Shaped 8,000 BTU inverter is the best narrow window air conditioner: quiet, efficient and sealed better than any box unit. For 21 to 22 inches, the LG LW5016 is the smallest standard unit worth buying. For horizontal sliders and casements, Frigidaire's slider/casement units are among the last mainstream options, so buy one when you see it in stock.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Measure the actual opening before anything else, size by square footage rather than buying the biggest unit that fits, and use a proper support bracket above the ground floor. If no window unit fits, a ductless mini-split is the long-term answer.
